# Mark the issue done

If this work fixes a GitHub issue, put `Fixes #N` in the pull request body before you open it. One line per finished issue.

GitHub closes the issue when that pull request is merged. Opening the pull request without that line leaves the issue open.

Do not write `Fixes` for an issue this change does not finish. Do not close an `idea` or `to-validate` issue until Master has said yes. Do not close issue #95.
